Reverses the ignore rule added in 6aafd6c so the bundle can be fetched from
the repo instead of copied by hand. The pipeline on the Windows VPS is not a
git clone, so it is updated from these artefacts:

  0001-0006*.patch          git format-patch series, 58ac711..71b32f4
  APPLY-ON-VPS.txt          order and instructions
  vps-files-2026-10-03/     complete copies of the 40 changed files, for
                            when applying patches is not practical
  vps-files-2026-10-03.tar.gz   the same, archived

The file copies are byte-identical to the tracked sources they came from.
No .env or credentials are included.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
